{"title":"2014 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/8/c/78cc238527a94a4ae05345fb8c6c579760ca5480.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10\\cdot\\left(\\tfrac{1}{2}+\\tfrac{1}{5}+\\tfrac{1}{10}\\right)^{-1}?$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"156\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/f/57f8ede8bf009ce5a1aebce01cbe863c25b8f262.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 3 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 8\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{25}{2} \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{170}{3}\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 170$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"404\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/e/12e21260e737c4ecc2bf7b4116b1f1e7bcde2b37.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[10\\cdot\\left(\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{1}{5}+\\frac{1}{10}\\right)^{-1}\\]\" width=\"164\" height=\"46\" />\nMaking the denominators equal gives\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/8/858522583ebacde2c4e851b8fd64c093086a668a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies 10\\cdot\\left(\\frac{5}{10}+\\frac{2}{10}+\\frac{1}{10}\\right)^{-1}\\]\" width=\"223\" height=\"46\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/c/b9c7e18416c20508fb4b4e0822b1c6183699a746.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies 10\\cdot\\left(\\frac{5+2+1}{10}\\right)^{-1}\\]\" width=\"187\" height=\"46\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/3/2832b440e25ccb94bfdd37a6c04898ff0c7544ca.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies 10\\cdot\\left(\\frac{8}{10}\\right)^{-1}\\]\" width=\"134\" height=\"46\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/3/6d309b6b45b8f4e35d741ae32ea81647183f0b5e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies 10\\cdot\\left(\\frac{4}{5}\\right)^{-1}\\]\" width=\"125\" height=\"46\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/1/8612999285ee03d02effd49381ab5a5a3aea86a6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies 10\\cdot\\frac{5}{4}\\]\" width=\"81\" height=\"38\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/0/0100cd85a3f1692e5c483ab0559633686ad33cdd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies \\frac{50}{4}\\]\" width=\"59\" height=\"38\" />\nFinally, simplifying gives\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/b/5fba06f914e8493aeae1d11cbb060a29311f3b7d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\implies \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{25}{2}}\\]\" width=\"106\" height=\"48\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/f/bbf8ad5578ed582621b5c63d4182c88e211562c8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\left(\\frac{1}{10}\\right)^{-1}\\cdot \\left(\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{5} + \\frac{1}{10}\\right)^{-1}\\]\" width=\"210\" height=\"46\" />By Distributive Property,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/c/36ced254e97009416e30a918a5873be9d3776858.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\left(\\frac{1}{20}+\\frac{1}{50}+\\frac{1}{100}\\right)^{-1}\\]\" width=\"158\" height=\"46\" />Now, we want to find the least common multiple of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/a/3dae29e5c194989d6a7f722c4949164a4c1f8a61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20, 50,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"51\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/a/36af3a317653fc5ff424093b4df40c2b4d5a6f5f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"31\" height=\"16\" /> so\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/a/d2ab602940470b5dd03bd09ffa7c057bfd8cfae0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{lcm}(20,50,100)=\\text{lcm}(2^2 \\cdot 5,2 \\cdot 5^2,2^2 \\cdot 5^2)=2^2 \\cdot 5^2=100\\]\" width=\"444\" height=\"20\" />Converting everything to a denominator of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/a/36af3a317653fc5ff424093b4df40c2b4d5a6f5f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"31\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/3/bb310752666bfc04f6311cae6fd9e37b6f4377b5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\left(\\frac{5}{100}+\\frac{2}{100}+\\frac{1}{100}\\right)^{-1}=\\left(\\frac{8}{100}\\right)^{-1}=\\frac{100}{8}\\]\" width=\"332\" height=\"46\" />Now, we use Euclidean Algorithm, to find if this fraction is reducible, so\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/c/36cf18d63b75b8ad0dd7cbeb2b0b9db88b0217f6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\gcd(100,8)=\\gcd(12,8)=\\gcd(4,8)=\\gcd(4,4)\\]\" width=\"368\" height=\"18\" />Thus, both the numerator and denominator are divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/5/4054552638cf9f29e857a1306bd3ec31df3c19b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"13\" height=\"15\" /> so\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/1/e616bd29d5fcd3e25ba81f89729a22c1bcfa3283.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{100}{8} \\cdot \\frac{4}{4}=\\frac{100}{4} \\cdot \\frac{4}{8}=25 \\cdot \\frac{1}{2}=\\boxed{\\frac{25}{2}}\\]\" width=\"264\" height=\"48\" />\n</p><p>- kante314\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28CREATIVE_THINKING.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING)\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/sbz01QUWY6A\">https://youtu.be/sbz01QUWY6A</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/QvkvhIMpXz8\">https://youtu.be/QvkvhIMpXz8</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A\">2014 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2014 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align